{"id": "68396", "title": "保安／掰弯这个兵", "author": "辣椒拌饭", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68396.htm", "intro": "某天，贵公子席昭然看上了退伍后在自家公司上班、并且救过自己几次的保安。\r\n\r\n于是贵公子坠入了爱河……\r\n\r\n为了掰弯并且得到这个冷硬的军人，贵公子十八般武艺齐上阵……\r\n\r\n不过其实他不知道，在掰弯某些人之前，\r\n\r\n首先需要看清的就是人家原本究竟是直是弯，否则一定会输得连裤底都不剩……\r\n\r\n沉默温柔攻VS外表优雅贵公子内心黑暗狠厉的诱受。\r\n\r\n直掰弯，温馨宠爱，1VS1，HE。\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 豪门世家 情有独钟 高干", "base": "files/article/html/68/68396", "chapters": [{"title": "序一：昏迷的贵公子", "file": "10527197.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序二：醉酒的贵公子", "file": "10527198.html", "available": false}, {"title": "别样的三顿饭（一）", "file": "10527199.html", "available": false}, {"title": "别样的三顿饭（二）", "file": "10527200.html", "available": false}, {"title": "别样的三顿饭（三）", "file": "10527201.html", "available": false}, {"title": "别样的三顿饭（四）", "file": "10527202.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-11", "file": "10527203.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12-17", "file": "10527204.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18-22", "file": "10527205.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23-27", "file": "10527206.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28-31", "file": "10527207.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32-35", "file": "10527208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-39", "file": "10527209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40-43", "file": "10527210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-47", "file": "10527211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "48-51", "file": "10527212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10527213.html", "available": false}]}